        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Colca to Arequipa"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:c3205ac1e20a266d",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "c50a1244eedb01b9f6422093ab2251fbe0f4b8e870c85a41779146a53462b1ba",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-chat-202611100526-00e424b1aafd",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, head to the **Cruz del Cóndor** viewpoint, about **1.5 hours** from Chivay.\n\nThis is a spot for watching Andean condors, whose wingspan can reach **3 meters**.\n\nThe itinerary describes Colca Canyon as roughly twice as deep as the Grand Canyon in the United States.\n\nAfter watching the condors, return to the hotel and depart for Arequipa.\n\nAlong the way, stop at viewpoints overlooking three volcanoes.\n\nArrive in Arequipa and check in at a three-star hotel. Free time."
    },
